id=a52sxq_bt_a2dp_offload
name=Galaxy A52s 5G Bluetooth A2DP offload for all codecs
author=kusti420
description=One UI 9's Bluetooth stack (com.android.bt APEX) only offloads the codecs listed in persist.bluetooth.samsung.a2dp_offload.cap, which the Fold8 product build.prop sets to its own DSP set sbc-aptx-ssc-hifi; AAC, aptX HD and LDAC went down a software encoding session that the A52s vendor audio HAL never reports ready for, so those headsets stayed silent. Sets the A52s DSP set sbc-aac-aptx-aptx_hd-ldac (build.prop plus an init re-apply after persist props load) and ships the source APEX with Bluetooth.apk patched to also accept AAC, aptX HD and LDAC (Samsung codec ids 0x2, 0x10, 0x40) as offload codecs, re-signed with the tethering patch keys.
